          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prayer time astronomy, by Batoul Apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer times": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "مواقيت الصلاة"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prayer times"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer times and the Qibla are calculated on your iPhone. Your records, settings and location are kept only on this iPhone, and are never sent anywhere. To name a place, an approximate position (about a kilometre) is looked up with Apple when you ask, or the city you type is searched in Apple Maps. Azkar has no account, no analytics and no ads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُحسب مواقيت الصلاة واتجاه القبلة على هاتفك. وتُحفظ سجلاتك وإعداداتك وموقعك على هذا الهاتف فقط، ولا تُرسل إلى أي جهة. ولمعرفة اسم مكان، يُبحث عن موقع تقريبي (في حدود كيلومتر) لدى Apple عندما تطلب ذلك، أو عن المدينة التي تكتبها في خرائط Apple. ولا يحتاج التطبيق إلى حساب، ولا يجمع إحصاءات، ولا يعرض إعلانات."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prayer times and the Qibla are calculated on your iPhone. Your records, settings and location are kept only on this iPhone, and are never sent anywhere. To name a place, an approximate position (about a kilometre) is looked up with Apple when you ask, or the city you type is searched in Apple Maps. Azkar has no account, no analytics and no ads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prayer times and the Qibla need a location. Your records stay as they are.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تحتاج مواقيت الصلاة واتجاه القبلة إلى موقع. أما سجلاتك فتبقى كما هي."
          }
        },
        "en": {
