    "When the sun doesn’t rise, doesn’t set, or stays too close to the horizon, use the times of the nearest latitude where every time can be calculated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إذا لم تشرق الشمس، أو لم تغرب، أو بقيت قريبة جدًّا من الأفق، تُعتمد مواقيت أقرب خط عرض يمكن فيه حساب المواقيت كلها."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the sun doesn’t rise, doesn’t set, or stays too close to the horizon, use the times of the nearest latitude where every time can be calculated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بياناتك"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data couldn’t be erased. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر مسح بياناتك. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data couldn’t be erased. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your location stays on this iPhone and is never followed in the background. Apple is asked for a place’s name only when you use these buttons: it receives an approximate position, or the city you type.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يبقى موقعك على هذا الهاتف ولا يُتتبَّع في الخلفية أبدًا. ولا يُسأل Apple عن اسم المكان إلا عند استخدامك هذين الزرّين، فيتلقّى حينها موقعًا تقريبيًا، أو اسم المدينة الذي تكتبه."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your location stays on this iPhone and is never followed in the background. Apple is asked for a place’s name only when you use these buttons: it receives an approximate position, or the city you type."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اسمك"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your prayer log, progress and settings are kept only on this iPhone, inside the app; removing the app removes them. Export a backup before you do, or before changing phones. A backup also opens in the Azkar website.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سجل صلواتك وتقدّمك وإعداداتك محفوظة داخل التطبيق على هذا الهاتف فقط، وتُحذف بحذفه. صدِّر نسخة احتياطية قبل ذلك، أو قبل تغيير هاتفك. ويمكن فتح النسخة الاحتياطية في موقع أذكار على الويب أيضًا."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your prayer log, progress and settings are kept only on this iPhone, inside the app; removing the app removes them. Export a backup before you do, or before changing phones. A backup also opens in the Azkar website."
          }
        }
      }
    },
